-- Regulation W, 12 CFR Part 223: the nouns.
--
-- Target compiler: main (see NOTES.md).
-- Source: ../../source/part223.txt (12 CFR Part 223, annual edition revised as of 2025-01-01).
-- This module holds DECLARE and nothing else: the things a witness could name
-- (who owns what, who sits on which board) and the choices the text leaves open.
-- Every rule is in the modules that import it.

IMPORT prelude

§ `The kinds of party`

-- 223.3(bb): "Person" means an individual, company, trust, joint venture, pool,
-- syndicate, sole proprietorship, unincorporated organization, or any other form of entity.
-- 223.3(f): "Company" means a corporation, partnership, limited liability company,
-- business trust, association, or similar organization and, unless specifically
-- excluded, includes a member bank and a depository institution.
DECLARE `Party kind` IS ONE OF
    Corporation
    Partnership
    `Limited liability company`
    `Business trust`
    Association
    `Similar organization`
    Individual
    Trust
    `Joint venture`
    Pool
    Syndicate
    `Sole proprietorship`
    `Unincorporated organization`
    `Other form of entity`

-- 223.2(b)(2) to (4): a company "engaged solely in" one of three activities is not an affiliate.
DECLARE `Sole activity` IS ONE OF
    `Holds the premises of the member bank`
    `Conducts a safe deposit business`
    `Holds obligations of the United States or its agencies`
    `Some other activity`

-- 223.2(b)(5): "Any company where control results from the exercise of rights arising out of a
-- bona fide debt previously contracted", for the period the text allows.
-- Whether the period is still running is a sequence question, so it is stated, not computed.
DECLARE `Debt control` IS ONE OF
    `Not held through a debt previously contracted`
    `Held through a debt previously contracted, within the authorized period`
    `Held through a debt previously contracted, period expired`

DECLARE Party HAS
    `name`                        IS A STRING
    `kind`                        IS A `Party kind`
    -- 223.3(k): an insured depository institution (the operating-subsidiary gloss is not computed)
    `is a depository institution` IS A BOOLEAN
    -- 223.3(p): a fact of the structure here; the activity tests of (p)(1) and (p)(2) are not computed
    `is a financial subsidiary`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `sole activity`               IS A `Sole activity`
    `debt control`                IS A `Debt control`
    -- 223.2(b)(1)(iv): an employee stock option plan, trust or similar organization
    -- that exists for the benefit of the shareholders, partners, members or employees
    -- of the member bank or any of its affiliates
    `is an employee benefit organization` IS A BOOLEAN

§ `The ownership and control inputs`

-- A holding of one class of voting securities (223.3(g)(1)(i): "25 percent or more of any class
-- of voting securities"). `held as fiduciary` is the fact 223.3(g)(2) turns on.
DECLARE Holding HAS
    `holder`            IS A STRING
    `issuer`            IS A STRING
    `class`             IS A STRING
    `percent of class`  IS A NUMBER
    `held as fiduciary` IS A BOOLEAN

-- An ordered pair of parties: the first is the controller, sponsor, person or the like, as the
-- list that holds it says.
DECLARE Link HAS
    `from` IS A STRING
    `to`   IS A STRING

-- Everything the regulation asks to be known about one member bank's surroundings.
DECLARE Structure HAS
    `the member bank`  IS A STRING
    `the parties`      IS A LIST OF Party
    `holdings`         IS A LIST OF Holding
    -- 223.3(g)(1)(ii): `from` controls in any manner the election of a majority of the directors,
    -- trustees or general partners of `to`
    `elections`        IS A LIST OF Link
    -- 223.3(g)(1)(iii): the Board has determined that `from` exercises a controlling influence
    -- over the management or policies of `to` (a determination after notice and hearing: stated)
    `determinations`   IS A LIST OF Link
    -- 223.2(a)(4): `from` is a person holding office as director, trustee or general partner
    -- (or an individual exercising similar functions) of the company `to`
    `offices`          IS A LIST OF Link
    -- 223.2(a)(5): `from` sponsors and advises `to` on a contractual basis
    `sponsorships`     IS A LIST OF Link
    -- 223.2(a)(10): `from` serves as a general partner of the partnership `to`, or causes a
    -- director, officer or employee of `from` to serve as a general partner of it
    `general partners` IS A LIST OF Link
    -- 223.2(a)(12): companies the Board or the appropriate Federal banking agency has
    -- determined, by regulation or order, to be affiliates (a determination: stated)
    `determined affiliates` IS A LIST OF STRING

§ `The readings the text leaves open`

-- 223.2(a)(2) with 223.3(f): the member bank is a company, and it is controlled by a company that
-- controls it, so on the literal words the member bank is its own affiliate.
DECLARE `Self-affiliation` IS ONE OF
    `The member bank is not its own affiliate`
    `The member bank is its own affiliate on the literal words`

-- 223.2(a)(4): "a majority of the persons holding any such office with the member bank or any
-- company that controls the member bank".
DECLARE `Interlock reading` IS ONE OF
    `One board at a time: the member bank, or one controlling company`
    `The offices of the member bank and of every controlling company pooled`

-- 223.2(b)(1)(iii)(A): "directly controlled by one or more affiliates".
-- 223.3(g) does not define "directly".
DECLARE `Direct control reading` IS ONE OF
    `Control through the controller's own holdings and elections, without attribution`
    `Any control, including securities attributed from subsidiaries`

-- 223.2(a)(11): "Any subsidiary of a company described in paragraphs (a)(1) through (10)".
DECLARE `Prong 11 reading` IS ONE OF
    `A subsidiary of a company described in paragraphs (a)(1) through (10) only`
    `A subsidiary of any affiliate, so that the prong chains`

-- 223.2(c): subpart F implements section 23B; the other subparts section 23A.
DECLARE Purpose IS ONE OF
    `Section 23A`
    `Subpart F, section 23B`

DECLARE Readings HAS
    `self-affiliation`      IS A `Self-affiliation`
    `interlock`             IS A `Interlock reading`
    `direct control`        IS A `Direct control reading`
    `prong 11`              IS A `Prong 11 reading`

§ `One question put to the rules`

-- The structure, the readings, the purpose, and the two control relations worked out from the
-- structure once (regw-control.l4), so that the rules for 223.2 do not work them out again at every
-- step.  `control` is every control pair; `direct control` is the set of pairs that count as
-- "directly controlled" under the reading chosen in `readings`.
DECLARE Inquiry HAS
    `structure`      IS A Structure
    `readings`       IS A Readings
    `purpose`        IS A Purpose
    `control`        IS A LIST OF Link
    `direct control` IS A LIST OF Link
